%% Courier settlement import, preflight, matching, and posting
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Admin as Tenant admin
    participant Web as Admin dashboard
    participant API as Settlement API
    participant Parser as Settlement parser
    participant DB as Tenant PostgreSQL
    participant Match as Settlement matcher
    participant Audit as Audit/reconciliation evidence

    Admin->>Web: Download canonical settlement template
    Web->>API: GET settlement template
    API-->>Web: Versioned headers and money-unit contract

    Admin->>Web: Upload courier settlement file
    Web->>API: POST settlement preflight
    API->>Parser: Validate type, headers, row count, and money units
    Parser->>Parser: Reject duplicate provider row refs
    Parser->>Parser: Validate fees/deductions do not exceed collection
    alt Invalid preflight
        Parser-->>Web: Row-level diagnostics and no posting
    else Valid preflight
        Parser-->>Web: Normalized candidate rows
        Web->>API: POST settlement with idempotency key
        API->>Match: Match shipment/order identity and collection evidence
        Match->>DB: Read eligible tenant collections
        DB-->>Match: Order/shipment evidence
        Match->>DB: Transactionally post settlement result with idempotency key
        DB-->>Match: MATCHED, SHORTFALL, or exception state
        Match->>Audit: Record source, row identity, actor, and outcome
        Match-->>Web: Idempotent settlement result
    end

    Admin->>Web: Retry same import command
    Web->>API: Same idempotency key
    API->>DB: Return original committed result
